-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  prj_pack_err_cwd.pcpp - Projects: pcpp pack with no folder, in a folder
  with no project.toml

  With no folder named, pack takes the current one (never searched above),
  as pcpp build does: the suite's output root holds no project.toml, a bad
  argument (exit 2). A cli test (pcpp itself, in the suite's output root);
  this file itself is never compiled.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe prj_pack_err_cwd;

/*
  @@test
    kind cli
    args "--no-banner pack"
    exitcode 2
    expect
    | Error: No project.toml in <OUT>
  @@end
*/

begin
end.
